    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet just 450m from the fantastic Cullenstown beach which holds a Green Coast Award this four bedroom bungalow style property is a great coastal retreat. \n\nThe home is within easy reach of Carrig on Bannow which provides a good village offering of pub, shop, takeaways, cafe, school, community centre and bus links. Wellingtonbridge is just 10 minutes away also offering a great variety of services for practical everyday living.\n\nThe accomodation extends to an entrance porch leading to the main hall off which you have a good size living room to the front with access to a seperate dining room. The kitchen and utility room are located to the rear with access to the rear of the property. There are four bedrooms with one ensuite and a seperate functional shower room. Outside the house is set on a site of 0.66 acres with lawned area to the front and rear with detached garage. \n\nViewing is a must here."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.1m x 1.56m\nTiled floor, wood panelled walls\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.1m x 3.35m + 4.5m x 0.88m\nCarpet flooring, attic access point\n\nLiving Room - 5.96m x 3.94m\nWood pellet stove, dual aspect windows, lino flooring, door to dining room\n\nKitchen - 5.98m x 3.5m\nFitted waist and eye level units with tiled splashback, plumbed for dishwasher, tiled splashback, coving\n\nDining Room - 4.14m x 3.1m\nCarpet flooring\n\nUtility Room - 2.7m x 2.7m\nTiled floor, rear access point, plumbed for washing machine\n\nShower Room - 3.03m x 1.8m\nTiled floor and shower unit, wc, wash hand basin, incorporating hot press\n\nBedroom One - 3.4m x 2.3m + 2.4m x 2.9m\nLaminate flooring, window to rear, coving\n\nBedroom Two - 3.9m x 2.6m + 3.4m x 2.9m\nLaminate flooring, window to side, incorporating ensuite which includes wc, tile floor, wash hand basin and Triton T90si shower\n\nBedroom Three - 4.48m x 3.1m\nTo front, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom Four - 3.1m x 3.1m\nTo front, carpet flooring\n\nGarage - 3.79m x 7.4m\nConcrete floor, roller door to front\n\n"
      },
      {
